<header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HUMAN GOLD RUSH LESSON</p><h1>Twelve-Week Snapshot</h1><p class="intro">The snapshot is a culmination of the complete twelve-week dataset, not the final step in a prescribed participant sequence.</p><blockquote>What did the full window of community activity reveal?</blockquote></header><section class="content-grid"><article><span>01</span><div><h2>One continuous record</h2><p>Invitations, pledges, gratitude, fulfillment, observation, disputes, walk-aways, and re-entry may occur at any point during the quarter.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h2>Snapshot, not redemption</h2><p>This page closes the behavioral dataset. It reports the quarter’s matured, disputed, settled, carried-forward, and extinguished outcomes without functioning as a payment screen.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h2>Show open states</h2><p>Report what matured, what was fulfilled, what remains open, what was disputed, and what cannot be concluded.</p></div></article><article><span>04</span><div><h2>Dataset-specific analysis</h2><p>Researchers may compare selected periods, sites, event types, or responses when a stated research question requires it. These are analytical views, not community stages.</p></div></article></section><section class="media-section"><div class="section-heading"><p>MEDIA FOR THIS LESSON</p><h2>Watch, listen, and discuss</h2></div><div class="media-grid"><article class="media-card video"><div class="media-frame"><span>▶</span><small>VIDEO 1</small></div><h3>Twelve-Week Snapshot: orientation</h3><p>Reserved for the featured story or introductory video.</p><a href="#">Transcript coming soon</a></article><article class="media-card video"><div class="media-frame"><span>▶</span><small>VIDEO 2</small></div><h3>Community conversation</h3><p>Reserved for a demonstration, conversation, or local example.</p><a href="#">Discussion guide coming soon</a></article><article class="media-card podcast"><div class="media-frame"><span>◉</span><small>PODCAST</small></div><h3>Listen and reflect</h3><p>Reserved for the facilitator or community podcast episode.</p><a href="#">Transcript coming soon</a></article></div></section><section class="content-grid"><article><span>05</span><div><h2>Three monthly testaments</h2><p>The quarter preserves each seller’s three month-end VFN postings alongside the Presence events. Corrections append; no earlier statement is overwritten.</p></div></article><article><span>06</span><div><h2>Settlement follows the dataset</h2><p>Eligible YAM-is-ON obligations settle at quarterly close. Seeking Gratitude closes as XP evidence only and can never enter monetary settlement.</p></div></article></section>
